in Napoleon hade kostat över 20 000 kronor. Och jag hade behandlat gallret som en utgift snarare än en investering.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Det var då jag beställde Mastern.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg5HKHt_pbr_srcSet_desktop_src","label":"gg5HKHt_pbr_srcSet_desktop_src","default":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/2005/9307/files/Rectangle_41017.png"},{"type":"html","id":"gg5HKHt_pbr_srcSet_mobile_src","label":"gg5HKHt_pbr_srcSet_mobile_src","default":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0947/0174/8548/files/download_9.gif"}],
